{"id":"e36bd3b6-3003-4edb-a611-1437227608a9","createdAt":"2026-10-26T13:25:24.113Z","batchId":"onboarding_claude-sonnet-5-5_low","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-sonnet-5-5","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\" style=\"max-width:640px\">\n<div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n<div>\n<h1>Welcome to Fieldnotes</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">Set up your workspace in three quick steps.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"stack\">\n<div class=\"row between small\">\n<span id=\"stepLabel\"><strong>Step 1 of 3</strong> · Account</span>\n<span class=\"muted\" id=\"pct\">33%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"bar\" style=\"width:33%\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"row gap-sm\" id=\"crumbs\">\n<span class=\"badge\" data-c=\"0\">1 Account</span>\n<span class=\"badge badge-outline\" data-c=\"1\">2 Preferences</span>\n<span class=\"badge badge-outline\" data-c=\"2\">3 Done</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n<section data-step=\"0\" class=\"stack\">\n<div><h3 class=\"card-title\">Create your account</h3><p class=\"card-desc\">You'll use these details to sign in.</p></div>\n<label>Full name<input id=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Maya Okafor\"></label>\n<label>Work email<input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"maya@studio.co\"></label>\n<label>Password<input id=\"pw\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\"></label>\n<p class=\"small muted\">Password must be at least 8 characters.</p>\n<div id=\"err\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<section data-step=\"1\" class=\"stack\" style=\"display:none\">\n<div><h3 class=\"card-title\">Your preferences</h3><p class=\"card-desc\">Tailor notifications and defaults. You can change these later.</p></div>\n<label>Primary use\n<select id=\"use\"><option>Personal notes</option><option>Team documentation</option><option>Research</option><option>Project planning</option></select>\n</label>\n<label>Digest frequency\n<select id=\"freq\"><option>Daily</option><option selected>Weekly</option><option>Never</option></select>\n</label>\n<label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"n1\" checked> Email me about comments and mentions</label>\n<label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"n2\"> Send product tips and updates</label>\n<label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"n3\" checked> Enable dark mode when my system does</label>\n</section>\n\n<section data-step=\"2\" class=\"stack\" style=\"display:none\">\n<div><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Complete</span>\n<h3 class=\"card-title\" style=\"margin-top:.5rem\">You're all set!</h3>\n<p class=\"card-desc\">Here's a summary of your setup.</p></div>\n<table class=\"table\"><tbody>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\">Name</td><td id=\"sName\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\">Email</td><td id=\"sEmail\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\">Primary use</td><td id=\"sUse\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\">Digest</td><td id=\"sFreq\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\">Notifications</td><td id=\"sNotif\"></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</section>\n\n<hr class=\"hr\">\n<div class=\"row between\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"back\">Back</button>\n<button class=\"btn\" id=\"next\">Next</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nlet s=0;\nconst names=[\"Account\",\"Preferences\",\"Done\"];\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id);\nfunction show(){\ndocument.querySelectorAll(\"[data-step]\").forEach(e=>e.style.display=+e.dataset.step===s?\"\":\"none\");\nconst p=Math.round((s+1)/3*100);\n$(\"bar\").style.width=p+\"%\";$(\"pct\").textContent=p+\"%\";\n$(\"stepLabel\").innerHTML=\"<strong>Step \"+(s+1)+\" of 3</strong> · \"+names[s];\ndocument.querySelectorAll(\"[data-c]\").forEach(b=>{b.className=\"badge\"+(+b.dataset.c===s?\"\":\" badge-outline\")+(+b.dataset.c<s?\" badge-secondary\":\"\")});\n$(\"back\").style.visibility=s===0||s===2?\"hidden\":\"visible\";\n$(\"next\").textContent=s===0?\"Next\":s===1?\"Finish setup\":\"Go to workspace\";\n}\n$(\"next\").onclick=()=>{\nif(s===0){\nconst e=$(\"err\");let m=\"\";\nif(!$(\"name\").value.trim())m=\"Please enter your name.\";\nelse if(!/^\\S+@\\S+\\.\\S+$/.test($(\"email\").value))m=\"Please enter a valid email address.\";\nelse if($(\"pw\").value.length<8)m=\"Password must be at least 8 characters.\";\ne.textContent=m;e.style.display=m?\"\":\"none\";\nif(m)return;\n}\nif(s===1){\n$(\"sName\").textContent=$(\"name\").value;\n$(\"sEmail\").textContent=$(\"email\").value;\n$(\"sUse\").textContent=$(\"use\").value;\n$(\"sFreq\").textContent=$(\"freq\").value;\nconst n=[];if($(\"n1\").checked)n.push(\"Mentions\");if($(\"n2\").checked)n.push(\"Product tips\");\n$(\"sNotif\").textContent=n.length?n.join(\", \"):\"None\";\n}\nif(s===2){$(\"next\").textContent=\"Opening…\";$(\"next\").disabled=true;return;}\ns++;show();\n};\n$(\"back\").onclick=()=>{if(s>0){s--;show();}};\nshow();\n</script>","deltas":[[2196,"<div class=\"page\""],[2542," style=\"max-width:640"],[2564,"px\">\n<"],[2564,"div class=\"stack g"],[2564,"ap-lg\">\n<div"],[2564,">\n<h1>Wel"],[2564,"come to F"],[2564,"ie"],[2564,"ldn"],[2564,"ot"],[2564,"es</h1>\n<p"],[2564," class=\"lead\">Set up"],[2595," your workspace in three"],[2908," qu"],[2909,"ick steps.</p>"],[2909,"\n</div>\n\n<div class"],[2909,"=\"stack\">\n<div class"],[2909,"=\"row between small"],[2909,"\">\n<span id"],[2909,"=\"st"],[2909,"epLabel\""]